比较 FY2025 10-K 与 2026 Q2 10-Q 的 Google Cloud 收入来源披露，指出变化及不能据此推断的内容。
UNTRUSTED DRAFT TO AUDIT:
{"status":"answered","claims":[{"text":"FY2025 10-K把 Google Cloud 收入来源披露为三类：Google Cloud Platform、Google Workspace 和 other enterprise services；其中 Cloud Platform 以“consumption-based fees and subscriptions”为主，Workspace 为订阅，另有其他企业服务。","citations":[{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000018","index_id":"didx-320f0efaace7b324","block_id":"block-000451-6ce30e96","quote":"Google Cloud Platform primarily generates consumption-based fees and subscriptions"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000018","index_id":"didx-320f0efaace7b324","block_id":"block-000452-43035749","quote":"Google Workspace includes subscriptions"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000018","index_id":"didx-320f0efaace7b324","block_id":"block-000453-9711d965","quote":"other enterprise services"}]},{"text":"2026 Q2 10-Q 的披露在保留前两类的同时，新增了“Product sales, primarily the sale of TPU systems”这一收入来源；因此，Q2 10-Q 对 Google Cloud 收入构成的明示来源比 FY2025 10-K 更细了一层。","citations":[{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000071","index_id":"didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5","block_id":"block-000531-fa802653","quote":"Google Cloud Platform primarily generates consumption-based fees and subscriptions"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000071","index_id":"didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5","block_id":"block-000532-d23aecf2","quote":"Google Workspace includes subscriptions"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000071","index_id":"didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5","block_id":"block-000533-abd62671","quote":"Product sales, primarily the sale of TPU systems"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000071","index_id":"didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5","block_id":"block-000534-d9e74cdc","quote":"Other enterprise services"}]},{"text":"两期文件对 Google Cloud Platform 的核心表述一致，都是“consumption-based fees and subscriptions”，未见该主来源表述变化。","citations":[{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000018","index_id":"didx-320f0efaace7b324","block_id":"block-000451-6ce30e96","quote":"consumption-based fees and subscriptions"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000071","index_id":"didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5","block_id":"block-000531-fa802653","quote":"consumption-based fees and subscriptions"}]}],"limitations":["不能据此推断 TPU systems 的销售是否在 FY2025 10-K 时已存在、是否当时占比很小、或仅在 10-Q 才首次发生；只能确定 10-Q 明示了这一来源，而 10-K 未在该段落列出。","不能据此推断 Google Cloud 总收入、增速、毛利、或各来源占比的变化；这里比较的是披露口径，不是分项金额。","不能据此推断“Product sales”是 Google Cloud 的唯一新增业务、也不能推断其对全年收入的贡献规模。"],"findings":["变化点是：2026 Q2 10-Q 新增披露 Google Cloud 的“Product sales, primarily the sale of TPU systems”。","未变化点是：Google Cloud Platform 仍主要来自消费型费用和订阅；Google Workspace 仍是订阅；仍披露其他企业服务。"],"stop_reason":"已比对两期原文，提取可核对的收入来源披露并说明可推断与不可推断范围。"}
